Third-party code and weights:

* Idol's model code is imported at run time from a checkout of https://github.com/speridlabs/idol-sdk
  (Apache License 2.0); it is not vendored.
* The Budget3D weights distributed in the BudgetAny model repositories are fine-tuned from speridlabs/idol and
  speridlabs/idol-turbo (Apache License 2.0) and are released under the Apache License 2.0.
* scripts/convert_dinov3_to_hf.py is adapted from the DINOv3 conversion script of the Hugging Face transformers
  library (Apache License 2.0).
